{"id":"0183981e6c8952fc","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-quantifier-rank.md","title":"Quantifier Rank","display":"df-quantifier-rank — Quantifier Rank","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-quantifier-rank","aliases":["88-df-quantifier-rank"],"display":"df-quantifier-rank — Quantifier Rank","depends_on":["[[88-df-language]]","[[88-df-formula]]","[[88-df-atomic-formula]]","[[88-df-variable]]","[[88-df-iota-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-quantifier-rank"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-quantifier-rank</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quantifier-rank — Quantifier Rank"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9df3c26c280af75a\" href=\"?note=9df3c26c280af75a\" title=\"88-df-atomic-formula\">88-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"03af5095ed087251\" href=\"?note=03af5095ed087251\" title=\"88-df-iota-operator\">88-df-iota-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Language}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9df3c26c280af75a\" href=\"?note=9df3c26c280af75a\" title=\"88-df-atomic-formula\">88-df-atomic-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 为候选秩函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QRSpec}_S(q)\">\\(\\mathrm{QRSpec}_S(q)\\)</span> 是下述递归子句谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota q\\,\\theta(q)\">\\(\\iota q\\,\\theta(q)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"03af5095ed087251\" href=\"?note=03af5095ed087251\" title=\"88-df-iota-operator\">88-df-iota-operator</a> 的背景集合论唯一描述；被绑定的是函数图变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是保留的自由参数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{qr}_S:\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{qr}_S:\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是量词秩函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{\\leq n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{\\leq n}\\)</span> 是秩不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的公式集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{QRSpec}_S(q)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\land q:\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\to\\mathbb N\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\;q(\\theta)=0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;q(\\neg\\varphi)=q(\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\nq(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=\\max\\{q(\\varphi),q(\\psi)\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\nq(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)=q(\\varphi)+1.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{QRSpec}_S(q)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\land q:\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\to\\mathbb N\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\;q(\\theta)=0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;q(\\neg\\varphi)=q(\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\nq(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=\\max\\{q(\\varphi),q(\\psi)\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\nq(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)=q(\\varphi)+1.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\to\\exists!q\\;\\mathrm{QRSpec}_S(q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\to\\exists!q\\;\\mathrm{QRSpec}_S(q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{qr}_S\\coloneqq\\iota q\\;\\mathrm{QRSpec}_S(q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{qr}_S\\coloneqq\\iota q\\;\\mathrm{QRSpec}_S(q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\to\\mathrm{QRSpec}_S(\\mathrm{qr}_S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\to\\mathrm{QRSpec}_S(\\mathrm{qr}_S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{\\leq n}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S:\\mathrm{qr}_S(\\varphi)\\leq n\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{\\leq n}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S:\\mathrm{qr}_S(\\varphi)\\leq n\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>存在唯一性证明。公式是由已给定的原子式和三个原始构造子生成的有限语法树。对树的构造深度归纳，每个子公式已有唯一的自然数秩；上述四个分支分别给出父节点的唯一自然数值。不同构造子的语法形状互斥，因而不会产生冲突。所有有限深度函数图之并是所需的总函数，另一满足子句的函数在同一归纳下逐点相等。</p>\n<p>因此描述项实际命名该秩函数，而非使用唯一性失败时的默认对象。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\">\\(\\exists\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lor\">\\(\\lor\\)</span> 等仍按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a> 的派生缩写展开，量词秩不另增不一致的原始分支。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"99f4e6abf02e07ae","anchor"