-df-variable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-iota-operator","status":"resolved","id":"03af5095ed087251","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\iota q\\,\\theta(q)$ 是 [[88-df-iota-operator]] 的背景集合论唯一描述；被绑定的是函数图变量 $q$，$S$ 是保留的自由参数。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"因此描述项实际命名该秩函数，而非使用唯一性失败时的默认对象。$\\exists$、$\\lor$ 等仍按 [[88-df-formula]] 的派生缩写展开，量词秩不另增不一致的原始分支。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Language}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QRSpec}_S(q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota q\\,\\theta(q)","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{qr}_S:\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{\\leq n}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{QRSpec}_S(q)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\land q:\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\to\\mathbb N\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\;q(\\theta)=0\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;q(\\neg\\varphi)=q(\\varphi)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\nq(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=\\max\\{q(\\varphi),q(\\psi)\\}\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\nq(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)=q(\\varphi)+1.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\to\\exists!q\\;\\mathrm{QRSpec}_S(q)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{qr}_S\\coloneqq\\iota q\\;\\mathrm{QRSpec}_S(q)","display":true},